  ('being-a-good-teammate', 268, 'Trust a teammate''s judgment on something specific today, and tell them so.'),
  ('being-a-good-teammate', 269, 'On a crisp autumn evening, jot down one tension from the day and one kind thing you could say tomorrow.'),
  ('being-a-good-teammate', 270, 'Remind a teammate who is hard on themselves of one thing they handled well this season.'),
