  ('being-a-good-teammate', 309, 'Stay on a video call one extra minute after a tough discussion to ask a colleague how they''re doing.'),
  ('being-a-good-teammate', 310, 'Greet the custodian, security guard or front desk staff by name on your way in this morning.'),
